                                        "entry_id": "8288c22f-e324-3fd5-9811-b0062972990b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An excessive indulgence in sensual pleasures; scandalous and immoral activities; involving sex, alcohol, or drugs without inhibition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
